export const content = "<p>Wondering how it feels to jump from the world&#8217;s highest bungee? feels awesome I tell you! A must do in your next trip to Macau!</p>\n<p>You can watch the whole video here: <a href=\"https://web.facebook.com/felixnoriel/videos/vb.1222719394/10203617269851969/?type=3\">GoPro Version</a> and <a href=\"https://web.facebook.com/felixnoriel/videos/vb.1222719394/10203617253851569/?type=3\">External Camera<br />\n</a>You can visit their website in <a href=\"https://www.ajhackett.com/macau/\">Aj Hackett Macau</a> for more details like updated prices etc.</p>\n<p>You can reserve your slot in advance or can walk-in as well. but make sure you come early since there are a lot of people lining up to jump off and you will then have to wait for couple of hours before your turn.</p>\n<p>They spelt my name wrong. It should be Noriel*.</p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-812 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/DSC_5431.jpg\" alt=\"highest bungee jumping macau\" width=\"875\" height=\"1313\" /></p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-815 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/DSC_5445.jpg\" alt=\"highest bungee jumping macau\" width=\"879\" height=\"1319\" /></p>\n<p>For some reason, I overcome my fear of heights after this jump.</p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-813 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/DSC_5432.jpg\" alt=\"highest bungee jumping macau\" width=\"880\" height=\"1321\" /></p>\n<p>I&#8217;m trying to relax myself because I&#8217;m jumping off next!</p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-814 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/DSC_5441.jpg\" alt=\"highest bungee jumping macau\" width=\"884\" height=\"1326\" /></p>\n<p>I was trying not to look down while walking at the edge. I might piss my pants if I did.</p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-816 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/DSC_5447.jpg\" alt=\"highest bungee jumping macau\" width=\"882\" height=\"1323\" /></p>\n<p>Last shot before jumping off.</p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-817 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/DSC_5454-.jpg\" alt=\"highest bungee jumping macau\" width=\"883\" height=\"1325\" /></p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-818 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/DSC_5456.jpg\" alt=\"highest bungee jumping macau\" width=\"881\" height=\"1322\" /></p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-819 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/DSC_5458.jpg\" alt=\"highest bungee jumping macau\" width=\"882\" height=\"1324\" /></p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-820 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/DSC_5460.jpg\" alt=\"highest bungee jumping macau\" width=\"876\" height=\"1314\" /></p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-821 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/DSC_5465.jpg\" alt=\"highest bungee jumping macau\" width=\"880\" height=\"1320\" /></p>\n<p>It was an overall awesome experience I had. I&#8217;m not planning to try this again unless there&#8217;s something that will be higher than this. haha.<br />\nI recommend this to all the adrenaline junkie out there.</p>\n<p>Check out my next heart stopping &amp; adrenaline rush activity, <a href=\"https://whoisfelix.com/blog/first-skydiving-experience/\">Skydiving</a></p>\n"
